          ${iconSvg('ear', 'regular', 'fig-ico')}
        </div>
        <div class="figure-cap">
          <span class="fc-num">Fig. 01</span>
          <span>The "eye of the heart": safe non-judgment (the stranger effect plus literal non-observation) combined with heightened auditory attention is a plausible mechanism for why blind listeners could be exceptional at this work. No direct trial yet tests it — this is where the 137-person field study compares against the literature.</span>
